    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are matching freelance projects to one specific freelancer.\n\nFREELANCER PROFILE:\n{{ $('Parse Profile').first().json.profile_json }}\n\nPROJECTS TO SCORE (JSON array):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.jobs.map(j => ({url: j.url, title: j.title, skills: j.skills, budget_usd_max: j.budget_usd_max}))) }}\n\nFor EVERY project in the array, score from 0 to 100 how well it fits this freelancer, and give one short sentence of reasoning.\n\nScoring rules:\n- 80-100: squarely in their core skills\n- 50-79: adjacent, they could do it with some stretch\n- 20-49: weak overlap\n- 0-19: wrong field entirely\nBe honest and be willing to give low scores. A project needing skills this freelancer does not have MUST score below 20. Do not credit them with skills absent from the profile.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array, no markdown fences, one object per project:\n[{\"url\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\", \"score\": 0, \"reason\": \"...\"}]"
      },
      "id": "546c5638-6d93-41c1-bf59-8bebb7b40591",
      "name": "Score Jobs vs Profile",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
