    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse the scoring output, sort by score, keep the top K the user asked for.\nlet raw = $input.first().json.text ?? $input.first().json.output ?? '';\nraw = String(raw).replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n\nlet scored;\ntry {\n  scored = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Scoring step did not return valid JSON. First 300 chars: ' + raw.slice(0, 300));\n}\nif (!Array.isArray(scored) || scored.length === 0) {\n  throw new Error('Scoring step returned no usable array of results.');\n}\n\n// K comes from the form; clamp it so a typo cannot ask for 900 matches\nconst asked = parseInt($('CV Upload Form').first().json.Matches, 10);\nconst k = Math.min(Math.max(Number.isFinite(asked) ? asked : 5, 1), 10);\n\nscored.sort((a, b) => (b.score ?? 0) - (a.score ?? 0));\nreturn [{ json: { top: scored.slice(0, k), total_scored: scored.length, k } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "219b5b2f-54f9-4b56-a3b9-879f9d55fadb",
      "name": "Rank and Take Top K",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1216,
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a short application pitch for each freelance project below, written in the voice of the freelancer.\n\nFREELANCER PROFILE:\n{{ $('Parse Profile').first().json.profile_json }}\n\nTOP PROJECTS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.top) }}\n\nFor each project write 3-4 sentences that:\n- open with the specific, relevant experience for THAT project\n- reference only skills and projects actually present in the profile\n- state concretely what you would do first\n- avoid greetings, sign-offs, and filler like \"I am excited\"\n\nNever invent experience the profile does not contain.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array, no markdown fences:\n[{\"title\": \"...\", \"url\": \"...\", \"score\": 0, \"pitch\": \"...\"}]"
      },
      "id": "575261a2-4f59-4ac3-9992-5d5b3c8a8a47",
      "name": "Write Pitches",
